30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":3487410546,"text":"えー、冒険者の皆さん、寄ってらっしゃい、見てらっしゃい。協会では新しいイベントを開催——","nextNodeIds":[736840102]},{"nodeId":736840102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":1472628298,"text":"このイベントに参加すれば、協会からの報酬だけじゃなく、追加のプレゼントまで——","nextNodeIds":[736840103,736840104]},{"nodeId":736840103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2857830058,"text":"冒険者協会でイベント？","nextNodeIds":[736840105]},{"nodeId":736840105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":2670892578,"text":"あなたは…旅人さんじゃないっすか！これはこれは、こんなところで先輩に会えるなんて！","nextNodeIds":[736840106]},{"nodeId":736840106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":4109134602,"text":"ご覧の通り、今、協会のあるイベントのために参加者を募集してるんっすよね。","nextNodeIds":[736840107]},{"nodeId":736840107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":3135451818,"text":"初めての協会からの正式なお仕事なんで、しっかりやんないと。","nextNodeIds":[736840108]},{"nodeId":736840108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2998439764,"text":"今回のイベントについて…","nextNodeIds":[736840109]},{"nodeId":736840109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":2439480274,"text":"あっ、そうだった！すんません、先輩はまだ今回のイベントを知らないんすよね！","nextNodeIds":[736840110]},{"nodeId":736840110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":1498882474,"text":"今回のイベントはジャック先輩が「野を越えた追跡」って名前にしたんすけど。","nextNodeIds":[736840111]},{"nodeId":736840111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":3317902450,"text":"ジャック先輩が言うには「簡単で面白くて、冒険者自身の実力を検証できる」イベントだそうっす。","nextNodeIds":[736840112]},{"nodeId":736840112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":2122756914,"text":"具体的に言うと、各地に「野跡風船」を設置する、みたいな？","nextNodeIds":[736840113]},{"nodeId":736840113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":951713586,"text":"そんで冒険者たちは、ヒントを参考にして「野跡風船」を見つけて、風船の分布の軌跡に沿って進むんすよ。","nextNodeIds":[736840114]},{"nodeId":736840114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":4160084338,"text":"限られた時間でより多くの「野跡風船」を集められれば、より評価は高くなり、報酬も増える、ってわけ。","nextNodeIds":[736840115,736840119]},{"nodeId":736840115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":597965042,"text":"その風船を割ったら…","nextNodeIds":[736840116]},{"nodeId":736840116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":3558593794,"text":"風船は特注品っすよ。普通の弓の射撃くらいなら耐えられるんで、近いところからしか割れないっす。","nextNodeIds":[736840117]},{"nodeId":736840117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":1662789458,"text":"まあ、前もこういうイベントをやったんすけど、冒険者たちは風船を見た瞬間、さって弓を上げて射るんすよね。何度言っても覚えてくれないし…","nextNodeIds":[736840118]},{"nodeId":736840118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":4096111002,"text":"だから今回、協会はこの特注風船をつかうことにしたんすよね。効果あるといいけど…","nextNodeIds":[736840124]},{"nodeId":736840124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":1148960850,"text":"あっ！雑談してる場合じゃなかった。参加者を募集しないと！","nextNodeIds":[736840125]},{"nodeId":736840125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":1847890370,"text":"まあ、興味があったら、参加してみてくださいよ！もし今回のイベントに参加してくれたら、ジャック先輩とサイリュス会長もきっと喜ぶっすから。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736840119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3005720282,"text":"ただの長距離走じゃないの…？","nextNodeIds":[736840120]},{"nodeId":736840120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":2327947802,"text":"あー…ジャック先輩が言うには…","nextNodeIds":[736840121]},{"nodeId":736840121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":2718766530,"text":"「風船を探すのは冒険者たちの『洞察力』を検証するためさ。色んな環境で進み続けることは冒険者たちの『基礎』を検証するためで…」","nextNodeIds":[736840122]},{"nodeId":736840122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":286319442,"text":"「『ヒントに沿って行動する』というのは冒険者たちの『規律』を検証するもの…」","nextNodeIds":[736840123]},{"nodeId":736840123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","textMapHash":4119099754,"text":"俺も協会に入ったばっかなんで、この手の事はよくわからないんすけど…でもジャック先輩が言うんだし、なんか絶対それなりの理屈があるんじゃないっすか？","nextNodeIds":[736840124]},{"nodeId":736840104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2351963802,"text":"今度は何をやってるの…","nextNodeIds":[736840105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7368401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["30276"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7368401],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30276,"speakerName":"フィンケル","count":20},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":5}],"raw":{"ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_ALL","BEGCMMJKCFC":[173684],"BHCBFLFOGJN":0,"BPEIDGPCLGA":false,"CBBBCAKOFGO":2180053046,"CHECNJEMEFE":{"30276":[1270]},"CJPLOBIFHLG":"MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE","CMDGLJAOFOJ":[],"EPJHBBICPCA":false,"FBEFCEJCBIK":{},"FFOAGHNMJKJ":0,"FNFALGGACGA":"","FOKHPBAGMPB":"","GBFMDJLKJBF":[],"GMENNHMBBOH":[],"HCJHEADFCAO":0,"IBEGAHMEABP":[{"<DLGBBMLABOA>k__BackingField":0,"ABDCADBLCFC":0,"AIMIPKGBAHC":"QuestDialogue/WQ/Sumeru_73684/Q7368401","ANDJNFLIDIJ":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","AOLKCANJCMJ":5,"BKDENCDKDEE":"","BPIIFMJLJAJ":[],"DAMGEPE